message: "If you use this package, please cite it as below."
title: "Near-miss constructions, interaction surfaces, and prime-support obstructions for the 3x3 magic square of squares"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Babanskyy
    given-names: Oleksiy
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-6176-6208"
